{'symbol': 'AAP', 'date': '2022-06-22 08:00:00', 'title': 'ADVANCE AUTO PARTS ACCELERATES EXPANSION INTO WESTERN U.S. WITH FIRST LOS ANGELES STORE OPENINGS', 'text': "RALEIGH, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ADVANCE AUTO PARTS ANNOUNCED IT HAS OPENED 22 NEW STORES IN THE LOS ANGELES MARKET AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S BROADER EXPANSION INTO THE WESTERN U.S."}